sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant V as Venue (D2C RFQ)
  participant G as Gateway
  participant J as Loop journals
  participant Q as Quoting engine (event loop)
  participant R as Risk engine
  participant H as Hedger
  participant S as Router

  C->>V: RFQ
  V->>G: FIX QuoteRequest
  G->>Q: QuoteRequest (templateId 10) on the inbound ring
  Q->>J: loop appends QuoteRequest, inbound
  Q->>R: pre-trade check (size, DV01 headroom)
  R-->>Q: ok
  Q->>Q: mid, skew from inventory, spread
  Q->>J: loop appends Quote (templateId 11), outbound
  Q->>G: Quote on the outbound ring
  G->>V: FIX Quote
  V->>C: dealer quotes
  C->>V: accept dealer quote
  V->>G: QuoteResponse (accept, cover price)
  G->>Q: QuoteResponse (templateId 12) on the inbound ring
  Q->>J: loop appends QuoteResponse, inbound
  Q->>R: position update
  R->>H: residual DV01 ladder
  H->>S: hedge order request
  S->>J: loop appends NewOrder (templateId 20), outbound
  S->>G: NewOrder to the chosen venue, outbound ring
